<title>PORTUGAL: Yield 5.935 pct on Portugal 5-yr bonds.</title>
<headline>Yield 5.935 pct on Portugal 5-yr bonds.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following is the result of the Portuguese Institute for Public Credit Management's auction of five-year, fixed-rate bonds (OT).</p>
<p>    ISSUER: Republic of Portugal   MATURITY:23/3/2002</p>
<p>    AMOUNT PLACED: 19.66 billion   AMOUNT OFFERED: 25 billion</p>
<p>    COUPON: 5.75     AVERAGE ACCEPTED YIELD: 5.934879</p>
<p>HIGHEST ACCEPTED: 5.95  LOWEST: 5.82</p>
<p>    BIDS: 46.71 billion     PAYMENT FREQUENCY:Annual</p>
<p>NOTES: The issue is fungible. The auction takes to 96.99 the total amount of the bonds issued.</p>
</text>
